diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 7f7eaaf..c47b67e 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,5 +1,11 @@
 # AdrenoMetal
 
+GPU052 carries upstream fixes 56ce432 and 6d4a3f3: texture descriptors and views
+preserve `allowGPUOptimizedContents`, and absent library functions report
+`MTLLibraryErrorFunctionNotFound` so a caller can continue its library search.
+The iPhone/A840 adaptations, GPU051 foreground allocation sizing, and existing
+multi-level transfer paths remain in place.
+
 Metal frontend through metal2vulkan and Turnip.
 
 The frontend uses metal2vulkan and Turnip with the kernel GPU interface and selected OS ABI. GPU composition has been verified on sheng with A740.
